Sakilabo.Unishox2

A C# re-implementation of Unishox2 (https://github.com/siara-cc/Unishox2).
The licenses that apply, and the copyright notices, are as follows.

Code derived from siara-cc/Unishox2

The compression and decompression logic and the data tables based on Unishox2
are licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The full text is in LICENSE-APACHE.txt.

